@startuml
title Deterministic read-only replay analysis

start
:Read manifest version 2 directly\nwithout lifecycle reconciliation;
:Select replay records\n(optionally restrict fingerprints);
:Validate source/build/map linkage;
:Read and hash optional JSONL files;
:Read evidence-only diagnostics\nfrom manifest otherEntries;
:Validate saved map schema and\ncanonical payload checksum;
:Revalidate raw schemas and\nstored per-response summaries;
:Merge chunks by tick / record ID;
if (Exact canonical overlap?) then (yes)
  :Retain source references\nand deduplicate for analysis;
elseif (Conflicting overlap?) then (yes)
  :Report fail for contradiction;\ndependent conclusions unknown;
endif
:Gate cross-record derivations by\ncompatible build provenance;
:Evaluate replay coverage and\nM2/M3 coveredTypes;
:Reconstruct membership only\nthrough uninterrupted evidence;
:Check actor/channel completeness,\nactor/target consistency, range,\nparts and command compatibility;
:Compare only consecutive snapshots\nfor displacement and health deltas;
:Emit deterministic JSON to stdout;
note right
  No selector reconstruction
  No lifecycle mutation
  No engine-effect causality
  No report file write
end note
stop

@enduml
